  "bio": "Bobbie is a supremely talented tattoo artist based in Frankfurt, Germany who specializes in illustrative and newschool styles, bringing a unique flair and creativity to every piece. Known for their uncompromising professionalism, Bobbie ensures that each client's experience is top-notch, focusing on both exceptional results and the highest standards of safety and cleanliness. Whether you're a local or traveling to get inked by Bobbie, you'll be in the hands of a true professional.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Frankfurt, Hesse, Germany\n\ntattoo artist + murals\nalways booking at : MAUDE :\n310 W. Holly St Bellingham, WA",
